            <h3 class="text-danger">The beginning</h3> 
            <p class="large-text">The outbreak began in the Arklay Mountains, Raccoon City</p> 
            <p>
                On the night of July 23, 1998, a series of bizarre cannibalistic murders occurred. 
                The S.T.A.R.S. Bravo team was dispatched to investigate, followed shortly by Alpha team. 
                What they discovered was a secret underground research facility owned by the Umbrella Corporation.
            </p> 
            <p>Following the Mansion incident, the T-Virus leaked into the Raccoon City water supply via infected rats, leading to a total city-wide collapse by late September.</p> 
            <p>
                Leon S. Kennedy, on his first day as a police officer, was late to his initiation, succesfully avoiding the chaos in the RPD Police Station... 
                Accompanied by Claire Redfield... encountered Sherry Birkin that was infected with the G-Virus.
            </p> 
